the minimum age requirement. By adding the bot to a server, you confirm
you have the authority to do so (e.g., you are an administrator of that
server).

### 3. Server administrators' responsibility

Moderation commands (`/ban`, `/kick`, `/timeout`, `/warn`, `/purge`,
etc.) carry out the action requested by the person typing them:
**moderation decisions remain the responsibility of the server's
administrators and moderators**, not the bot operator. Dashboard access
only shows and lets you edit servers where your own Discord account
already has management permissions.

### 4. Acceptable use

You may not use TMG to:

