- attempt unauthorized access to other servers, data, or accounts;
- deliberately overload the bot or dashboard (e.g., command spam).

The operator may suspend the bot's access to a server, or a dashboard
account, in case of abuse.

### 5. Service availability

TMG is provided **"as is"**, without guarantees of uninterrupted
operation. Maintenance, Discord platform changes, or infrastructure
issues may cause temporary downtime. The operator does not guarantee
that logs, warnings, or settings will never be lost, although the system
is designed to be reliable.

### 6. Limitation of liability

To the extent permitted by law, the operator is not liable for indirect
damages, data loss, or consequences arising from use (or inability to
use) the bot — including moderation actions carried out by server
administrators through TMG's commands.

### 7. Changes and termination of service

The operator may modify or discontinue the service at any time,
including removing the bot from a server. Server administrators can
remove the bot whenever they choose; doing so automatically deletes the
related settings and warnings, as described in the
[privacy policy](./PRIVACY.md).

### 8. Changes to these terms

The operator may update this document; the date at the top reflects the
latest revision. Continued use of the bot after a change means you
